// @stdout PASS a file the bridge creates is not executable
// @stdout PASS a file opened through the bridge does not reach a child
// @stdout PASS a copy carries the permission bits on the systems that have them
// @stdout PASS permissions read back as they were set, and only the nine low bits are set
// @stdout PASS the permissions of nothing report why
// @stdout PASS a copy of the permissions of nothing reports why
// @stdout PASS a name outside the system code page survives every bridge
// @stdout 16/16 tests passed
